      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think I\u0027d prefer it if we computed the ranges on-demand (still cached), rather than precomputing them up front.\n\nI\u0027m assuming that we\u0027re going to add various other objects that we compute ranges for (e.g. `let` declarations, `var` values, etc). We only really want to do the analysis for the values that we need for the transform that\u0027s using them, so it\u0027d be more efficient to do the analysis lazily.\n\nSo I\u0027d recommend making this a `GetOrAdd()` instead, where the lambda does the work to determine the range for the given parameter. LMK if you need more guidance.",
      "revId": "b7ca509ddcbc53110e440c854dc967eaaf02852f",
